    "turn_text": "My view is there should be no change to the President's Pearl Authority. It is a key tool, especially during times of global unrest. To take away that tool, I think would completely undermine the executive and undermine our ability to respond quickly to challenges outside of our control, outside of our borders. We've seen that Congress isn't quick to act in times of that kind of global emergency and global challenge. And it would undermine our executive and our country. So I would support zero changes to Pearl.",
