    "turn_text": "As a member of Congress who was trapped in the gallery on January 6th, I think it was a real dereliction of duty on the part of senators who voted to acquit him. And they actually helped create this moment where the very person who was responsible for that January 6th attack against our capital, against our constitutional republic, against our democracy, the blame really lies at the feet of those senators who failed to convict him. They have an obligation to face up to this moment and do the right thing and speak out openly against their nominee. This should be a test for them as well. But I look forward to defeating Donald Trump once again.",
