    "turn_text": "The President of the United States is not a young man. And this seems to be on the minds of a lot of voters. as co-chair of one of the co-chairs of this campaign, what do you say to a lot of Democrats who are like, is this a great idea? I mean, maybe we should have had a primary, maybe he should have stepped aside. He seems old.",
